          "elements": [
            {
              "id": "25417e60",
              "elType": "widget",
              "widgetType": "text-editor",
              "settings": {
                "editor": "<p style=\"text-align:right;font-size:13px;color:#999;font-family:Inter,sans-serif;margin-bottom:24px;\">Last Updated: <strong>[DATE — e.g. 1 June 2026]</strong></p>\n<h2 style=\"font-family:Playfair Display,serif;color:#1B3B2B;\">1. Who We Are</h2>\n<p>This Privacy Policy applies to <strong>Burans Valley</strong>, operated by <strong>[YOUR LEGAL COMPANY NAME]</strong>, registered at <strong>[REGISTERED ADDRESS, UTTARAKHAND]</strong>, India. Website: <strong>[YOUR DOMAIN]</strong>.</p>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-family:Playfair Display,serif;color:#1B3B2B;\">2. What Information We Collect</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Account &amp; Order Data:</strong> Name, email, phone, billing and shipping address when you order or register.</li>\n<li><strong>Payment Data:</strong> We do <em>not</em> store card details. Payments are handled by <strong>[PAYMENT GATEWAY — e.g. Razorpay]</strong> under their own privacy policy.</li>\n<li><strong>Usage Data:</strong> Pages visited, browser, device, IP address — collected via cookies and analytics.</li>\n<li><strong>Communications:</strong> Messages you send via email, WhatsApp, or contact forms.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-family:Playfair Display,serif;color:#1B3B2B;\">3. How We Use Your Information</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>To process and fulfil orders and send confirmations.</li>\n<li>To provide customer support.</li>\n<li>To send transactional notifications (shipping updates, invoice).</li>\n<li>To send marketing communications — <em>only with your explicit consent</em>. Unsubscribe at any time.</li>\n<li>To improve our website through anonymised analytics.</li>\n<li>To comply with Indian law.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-family:Playfair Display,serif;color:#1B3B2B;\">4. Cookies</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Strictly Necessary:</strong> Required for the website and checkout to function.</li>\n<li><strong>Analytics:</strong> Google Analytics (anonymised IP).</li>\n<li><strong>Marketing:</strong> Only placed with your consent via our cookie banner.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-family:Playfair Display,serif;color:#1B3B2B;\">5. Data Sharing</h2>\n<p>We share your data only where necessary: <strong>[COURIER PARTNER]</strong> for shipping; <strong>[PAYMENT GATEWAY]</strong> for transactions; analytics providers (anonymised); legal authorities if required by Indian law. We do <strong>not</strong> sell your personal data.</p>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-family:Playfair Display,serif;color:#1B3B2B;\">6. Data Retention</h2>\n<p>Order and account data is retained for a minimum of <strong>7 years</strong> as required by Indian tax regulations. Marketing consent is retained until withdrawn.</p>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-family:Playfair Display,serif;color:#1B3B2B;\">7. Your Rights</h2>\n<p>You may access, correct, or request deletion of your data, and withdraw marketing consent at any time. Email: <strong>[CUSTOMER SUPPORT EMAIL]</strong>.</p>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-family:Playfair Display,serif;color:#1B3B2B;\">8. Data Security</h2>\n<p>We use SSL/TLS encryption and secure hosting. If you discover a security issue, please notify us immediately.</p>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-family:Playfair Display,serif;color:#1B3B2B;\">9. Children</h2>\n<p>Our site is not directed at children under 18. We do not knowingly collect data from minors.</p>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-family:Playfair Display,serif;color:#1B3B2B;\">10. Changes to This Policy</h2>\n<p>We may update this policy from time to time. The date above reflects the latest version. Continued use constitutes acceptance.</p>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-family:Playfair Display,serif;color:#1B3B2B;\">11. Contact</h2>\n<p>For privacy-related queries, contact our Grievance Officer — see our <a href=\"/grievance-redressal\" style=\"color:#1B3B2B;font-weight:500;\">Grievance Redressal page</a>.</p>\n",
                "typography_typography": "custom",
